# The text of error 11 (QB64PE-DIVERGENCES.md D-052; study\39 row 12): error 11 goes the way of any other error now
# (d052-division-error-trappable.edit), and libqb's table of error texts has no entry for it, since it was only ever
# reported as a critical error. Without one, an untrapped division by zero prints "Unprintable error".
file: internal/c/libqb/src/error_handle.cpp
--- old
        case 10: return "Duplicate definition";
        case 12: return "Illegal in direct mode";
--- new
        case 10: return "Duplicate definition";
        case 11: return "Division by zero";
        case 12: return "Illegal in direct mode";
--- end
